    <CHAPTER cnumber="8">
      <VERS vnumber="1">O <gr str="5414">that </gr>thou <STYLE css="font-style:italic">wert</STYLE> as my <gr str="251">brother</gr>, that was nourished <gr str="3243">at </gr>the <gr str="7699">breasts </gr>of my <gr str="517">mother</gr>! <STYLE css="font-style:italic">when</STYLE> I should <gr str="4672">find </gr>thee <gr str="2351">outside</gr>, I would <gr str="5401">kiss </gr>thee; yea, I should not be <gr str="936">despised</gr>. <DIV>
