      <VERS vnumber="4">I <gr str="7650">charge </gr>you, O <gr str="1323">daughters </gr>of <gr str="3389">Jerusalem</gr>, that ye stir <gr str="5782">not</gr>, nor <gr str="5782">awake </gr>
