      <VERS vnumber="5">Who <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is</STYLE> this that cometh <gr str="5927">up </gr>from the <gr str="4057">wilderness</gr>, <gr str="7514">leaning </gr>upon her <gr str="1730">beloved</gr>? I <gr str="5782">awakened </gr>thee under the apple <gr str="8598">tree</gr>: there thy <gr str="517">mother </gr>brought thee <gr str="2254">forth</gr>: there she brought thee <gr str="2254">forth </gr>
