      <VERS vnumber="11">
        <gr str="8010">Solomon </gr>had a <gr str="3754">vineyard </gr>at <gr str="1174">Baalhamon</gr>; he let <gr str="5414">out </gr>the <gr str="3754">vineyard </gr>to <gr str="5201">keepers</gr>; every <gr str="376">one </gr>for the <gr str="6529">fruit </gr>of it was to <gr str="935">bring </gr>a <gr str="505">thousand </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">pieces</STYLE> of <gr str="3701">silver</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="12">My <gr str="3754">vineyard</gr>, which <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is</STYLE> mine, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is </STYLE>
